# Single edit point for the @openma/common release Clash CI consumes.
#
# PENDING — temporary pin to an UNRELEASED openma-common commit
# (openma-ai/openma-common#31, branch feat/acp-headless-launch-pinned-install).
# OPENMA_COMMON_TAG is empty because no tag names this commit yet. Once the
# maintainer releases it, set the SHA and TAG of that release here and change
# every `github:openma-ai/openma-common#<sha>` manifest ref to the tag.
# Do not merge a PR that still carries an empty OPENMA_COMMON_TAG.
#
# v0.7.0 through v0.7.9 publish no GitHub release tarball (assets empty; the
# conventional download is 404). Leave both tarball fields empty together.
# Set both when a release asset exists.
OPENMA_COMMON_SHA=cd5cf3c17c770be445ee46c2e188290a678e0fee
OPENMA_COMMON_TAG=
OPENMA_COMMON_TARBALL_SHA256=
OPENMA_COMMON_TARBALL_URL=
